PROVENANCE

This repository was created from `research-ultra-rag-mcp-server`, an independent
MCP server over the same engine. That server is archived. Historical on-disk
compatibility identifiers remain so existing research projects stay readable;
dependency retirement does not rewrite their artifacts.

    research-ultra-rag-mcp-server
    seed commit 0f5da3d611ae12b9807bae93c7f270b7d303b35f
    https://github.com/AhmedKishki/research-ultra-rag-mcp-server

The early retrieval, extraction, generation, and storage implementations derive
from that project. This repository maintains its own implementations, product
surfaces, command names, settings, and documents. The original history remains
in the archived repository.

